Package: rfcomm-relay
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, bluez
Description: RFCOMM to Nostr relay bridge
 Bridges Bluetooth RFCOMM connections to a local Nostr relay via
 WebSocket. Used by KeyMaster to transport key operations over
 Bluetooth Classic without IP networking.
